{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>中共總書記、國家主席習近平到內蒙古烏蘭察布考察。</p><p></p><p>習近平周五上午到當地的黃旗海自然保護區，聽取內蒙古加強生態環境保護等情況。之後又到，察哈爾高新技術開發區，了解綠色算力產業發展。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.INSPECTION-2000.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20266uT3MqEg2p1792154058.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>他稱算力產業正處於加速發展階段，前景廣闊，要認真落實，高效、綠色、安全的要求，做好算力中心項目建設和營運，積極推動綠色算力產業發展，為推進數字中國建設，促進新質生產力發展作出更多貢獻。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T13:20:22.687600+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T11:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T21:17:57.439763+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T13:17:52.234410+00:00","content_hash":"9c6f9d1bc6556b23f97a9f1f25bfd999a0ff27d23076d6121090651af04e3430","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}